			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210340501,
					"content": "#旅行者，{F#妳}{M#你}已經把那片營地裡的魔物都清理掉了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340502,
						210340503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340502,
					"content": "已經清理乾淨了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340504,
					"content": "只是一些尋常魔物，沒有費太多力氣。而且我的運氣不錯，找到了一枚頗有價值的長劍碎片。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340505,
					"content": "我那邊沒有發現…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340506,
					"content": "#無需掛懷，{F#妳}{M#你}也算是幫我排除了一處錯誤地點，多謝了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340507,
					"content": "#這些報酬是給{F#妳}{M#你}的，請收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340508,
						210340509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340508,
					"content": "要是能找到所有碎片…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340510,
					"content": "我想做的很簡單，那就是…重鑄「藏鋒」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340511,
					"content": "雖然原來鑄造「藏鋒」時所用的圖紙已經遺失，我也不知道到底用了什麼材料鑄造…但總會有辦法的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340512,
					"content": "如果我真能重鑄「藏鋒」，那兄長他想必也…唉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340509,
					"content": "妳找這些碎片做什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340503,
					"content": "妳這邊怎麼樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340504
					]
				}
			]
		},
