					"nextDialogs": [
						210340604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340604,
					"content": "只是一些尋常魔物，沒有費太多力氣…可惜沒找到什麼有價值的東西，都是一些破銅爛鐵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340605,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}那邊呢？有什麼發現嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340606,
					"content": "找到了這個。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340607,
					"content": "唔…這確實是一把劍的碎片…多謝，我會拿回去好好看一下的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340608,
					"content": "#多謝{F#妳}{M#你}了，旅行者，這些報酬是給{F#妳}{M#你}的，請收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340609,
						210340610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340609,
					"content": "要是能找到所有碎片…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340611,
					"content": "我想做的很簡單，那就是…重鑄「藏鋒」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340612,
					"content": "雖然原來鑄造「藏鋒」時所用的圖紙已經遺失，我也不知道到底用了什麼材料鑄造…但總會有辦法的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340613,
					"content": "如果我真能重鑄「藏鋒」，那兄長他想必也…唉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340610,
					"content": "妳找這些碎片做什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340603,
