				{
					"id": 210340801,
					"content": "哼，看來這傢伙就在這裡了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340802,
						210340803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340802,
					"content": "嵐姐？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340804
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340804,
					"content": "#咦？真巧，居然又在這裡遇見{F#妳}{M#你}了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340805,
					"content": "沒錯，我又從協會裡找到了一些…呵呵，比較「適合」的委託。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340806,
					"content": "#情況還是和上次一樣，而且我這次也想請{F#妳}{M#你}和我一起去掃清那些魔物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340807,
					"content": "#左邊的營地聚集著一群丘丘人，雖然對{F#妳}{M#你}來說，單個丘丘人並不難對付…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340808,
					"content": "#但這裡丘丘人的數量不少，如果它們一擁而上，只怕{F#妳}{M#你}也需要費一番手腳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340809,
					"content": "右邊是一個「丘丘岩盔王」，它的危險程度…我應該也不用解釋了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340810,
					"content": "#是我請{F#妳}{M#你}幫的忙，就由{F#妳}{M#你}先選一片營地吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340803,
					"content": "妳還在找那把劍的碎片嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
